**Script bug (not a gate failure), reproducible twice.** `gates.sh` puts the `al` bash *function* behind `env`:

```sh
env $e=1 GGML_METAL_DEVICE_INDEX=1 al 900 $B/llama-bench ... -o csv 2>/dev/null | tail -1 | awk ...
```

